1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,065
Konektor sudah dipasang, tapi
Events Manager masih kosong.

2
00:00:03,065 --> 00:00:03,984
Nyambung atau belum?

3
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:09,781
Pertama, pastikan nomor WhatsApp
sudah terhubung di Konektor.

4
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:14,323
Di Tracking Website, tambah platform Meta.

5
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:18,541
Isi Pixel ID, Access Token, dan
WhatsApp Business Account ID.

6
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:20,386
Simpan.

7
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:25,375
Klik Uji kirim, masukkan Test Event
Code dari Events Manager.

8
00:00:25,375 --> 00:00:27,665
Terkirim artinya kredensialnya benar.

9
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:32,011
Sekarang kirim satu chat uji lewat iklan.

10
00:00:32,011 --> 00:00:33,540
Lead masuk, sumbernya ads.

11
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:37,518
Ubah status jadi Dihubungi.

12
00:00:37,518 --> 00:00:40,573
Konektor kirim ke Meta:
LeadSubmitted, diterima.

13
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:44,036
Buka Events Manager.

14
00:00:44,036 --> 00:00:45,123
LeadSubmitted muncul!

15
00:00:45,123 --> 00:00:46,004
Pipanya nyambung.

16
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:53,698
Mulai besok, setiap lead dari iklan tercatat
di Meta, bukan cuma jumlah chat.

17
00:00:55,800 --> 00:00:56,616
Belum muncul?

18
00:00:56,616 --> 00:00:58,060
Cek Pixel ID dan token.

19
00:00:58,060 --> 00:01:01,199
Kalau gagal, alasannya tertulis
di Log pengiriman.

20
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:06,070
Panduannya, di konektor.id.
